    "title": "Penelope Disick Shocks With Rare Appearance, Poses Next To North - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Hailee Dent ,\n5 hours ago Penelope Disick has shocked fans with a rare appearance. She was posing with her cousin, North West, at Coachella. Penelope looks so grown up, and this is not what fans were expecting to see. However, they love it and loved seeing the cousins together. This was a great reunion, and Penelope looked fantastic. She does not have social media, so this was the first time she has been seen in a while. Keep reading to find out more about this situation. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
